# imgui rewrites this every session, so a tracked copy is pure churn. Kept
# consistent with preferences.json above: both are per-user session state, not
# project source. A canonical default layout, if ever wanted, ships as
# default_imgui.ini the way Reference/ does.
imgui.ini
